			"content": "<p><span class=\"h-card\" translate=\"no\"><a href=\"https://social.bennypowers.dev/@bp\" class=\"u-url mention\" rel=\"nofollow noopener\" target=\"_blank\">@<span>bp</span></a></span> <span class=\"h-card\" translate=\"no\"><a href=\"https://fediverse.zachleat.com/@zachleat\" class=\"u-url mention\" rel=\"nofollow noopener\" target=\"_blank\">@<span>zachleat</span></a></span> or build a working app that works everywhere always. Can't wait for the DSD to be production ready but this ain't it.</p>",
