			"date": "2023-10-10T16:24:35.000Z",
			"content": "<p><span class=\"h-card\" translate=\"no\"><a href=\"https://piaille.fr/@tbroyer\" class=\"u-url mention\" rel=\"nofollow noopener\" target=\"_blank\">@<span>tbroyer</span></a></span> <span class=\"h-card\" translate=\"no\"><a href=\"https://fediverse.zachleat.com/@zachleat\" class=\"u-url mention\" rel=\"nofollow noopener\" target=\"_blank\">@<span>zachleat</span></a></span> dsd would still get you fouc and cls in that case, depending on what's in the shadow root</p><p>but point taken</p>",
